    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879050/extras/1b8e61c83ac166d619f9a73221ce52ec.avif?t=1734498511\" width=540 height=404 /></span><br><strong>Character collecting RPG, FANTASY QUEST: ERRAND SAGA!</strong><br><br><strong>( Request Announcement )</strong><br>Bin, has been brainwashed by the demon 'Basilisk'.<br>Visit the mercenary agency 'Ninas Errand' on the continent of Mirgard.<br><br><strong>( About the Game )</strong><br>\u25b6the story Behind the Commission<br>  - Organize a group of mercenaries and save the city from a group of demons.<br>  - Find clues about the &quot;Soul Eyes&quot; who brainwashed Bin.<br><br>\u25b6performing the 'ninas errand' Commission<br>  - You'll take on any assignment, and you'll need to complete it successfully.<br>  - We encourage you to take on a variety of quests and events.<br><br>\u25b6assemble Your Own Mercenary Squad<br>  - You can collect, train, and develop around 50 unique mercenaries.<br>  - Train them, but don't forget to socialize with them.<br><br>\u25b6brain-teasing Strategy Elements<br>  - Build your own deck, taking into account each class and their attributes.<br>  - 3x3 tile layout for an always-on passive.<br><br>\u25b6Spectacular combat that's a feast for the eyes and ears<br>  - Experience cool skill effects and colorful BGM/SFX.<br>  - Bring your battles to life.<i><u><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li></li></ul></u></i>",
